---PAGE supage
---LINES
stdfile	= c ".ashstd"
vexdir  = v    -       -       cvt_sp  -       vexdir
hl      = gc    -       -       cvt_hl  -       "-"
f       = ipv   -       -       -       -       f
i       = ipv   -       -       -       -       i
o       = ipv   -       -       -       -       o

panl    = ipa   -       onoff   cvt_a   -       pF
scrl    = ipa   -       onoff   cvt_a   -       sF
hist    = ipa   -       onoff   cvt_a   -       hF
clck    = ipa   -       onoff   cvt_a   -       cF
ymax    = ipv   -       "%4d"   -       t_ymax  yy_max





---SCREEN
  please, press .:HE.... again to get generic help about keyboard and screen

 ."flags:  ".  ."description                                                 ". 
 history/sync  keep history in file; sync every command or save on exit only 
 scroll        keep comand listing on screen or clear screen after
 panel/keybar  show description of keys 0-9
 title(who)    title of session (user,host,current dir if configured)
 title on xterm window if supported by X window manager
 mail_biff     indicate new mail incoming
 clock         show current time on the screen
 lines max     maximum lines allowed for main menu on screen

               ."readonly runtime parameters                                 ".
 maxli/maxco   maximum lines/columns (size of the screen)
 vexdir        directory where configuration files reside

               ."setup parameter for debug only                              ".
               NOTE: it's better to don't touch if not sure, read manual
 -i:           input file, modification caused new scan of main menu
 -f:           command for fill of main menu
 -@:           substitution rule
 -o:           parameter not used
---END
